    "Name": "Ti Ts'ang",
    "Details": "Used by Kelley Metz, this Ti Ts'ang is slower than other variants, but it is equipped with a Supercharger and Improved Jump Jets. It carriers 12 Double Heat Sinks that cannot contain the heat of 5 ER Medium Lasers and 2 ER Small Lasers. As a complementary weapon, it carries a Hatchet. Endo-steel and an XL engine are needed to make this variant work.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
